他是一名醫生。

188
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,660
Thank you very much.
非常感謝。

189
00:09:02,740 --> 00:09:04,140
Oh, just like you always wanted.
哦，就像你一直想要的那樣。

190
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:04,820
Congratulations.
恭喜。

191
00:09:05,220 --> 00:09:05,960
Thank you.
謝謝。

192
00:09:06,380 --> 00:09:07,520
So, how about you?
那麼，你呢？

193
00:09:07,860 --> 00:09:08,960
