然後...

232
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:21,180
Hi again.
又嗨了。

233
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:23,080
Hey.
嘿。

234
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:29,100
Hey.
嘿。

235
00:11:29,740 --> 00:11:31,040
Thank you so much.
太感謝了。

236
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:32,640
Oh, no, no, no, no, don't thank me.
噢，不，不，不，不，別謝我。

237
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,260
Thank the jerk that didn't show up.
感謝那個沒有出現的混蛋。

238
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:37,000
Okay, I got to get to work.
好吧，我得去上班了。

239
00:11:37,100 --> 00:11:40,100
And not just for the money, but also because every now and then
不只是為了錢，還因為時不時地

240
