所以？

268
00:13:20,780 --> 00:13:21,600
Oh, wow.
哦，哇。

269
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,800
Were you just going to give me lemonade?
你只是要給我檸檬水嗎？

270
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:23,800
Yeah-huh.
是啊哈。

271
00:13:25,080 --> 00:13:26,400
