他們經常這樣做。

347
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,640
Hey, you want a beer?
嘿，你想喝啤酒嗎？

348
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:54,380
Yeah, I'll go get one.
是的，我去買一個。

349
00:16:54,480 --> 00:16:55,100
No, no, don't get up.
不，不，別起來。

350
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:56,200
I got a cooler right here.
我這裡有一個冷卻器。

351
00:16:58,300 --> 00:16:58,940
Okay.
好的。

352
00:17:01,180 --> 00:17:01,820
Hello.
你好。

353
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:02,500
Hey.
嘿。

354
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:04,560
Do you have any beers? We're out of beers.
你們有啤酒嗎？我們的啤酒沒了。

355
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:06,460
Help yourself.
幫助自己。

356
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:09,000
You okay?
你還好嗎？

357
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,160
Phoebe moved out.
菲比搬出去了。

358
00:17:15,940 --> 00:17:16,580
Right.
正確的。

359
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:18,960
I don't understand.
我不明白。

360
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,240
Am I so hard to live with?
